# The retired guest guide → the in-house one.
#
# oujaguide.netlify.app was the guide until it came in-house. Every message we
# ever sent a guest carries a link to it, and those messages cannot be recalled —
# on 2026-08-08 a guest tapped .../a2 and got "Site not found". Re-creating the
# site name with nothing but these rules turns every one of those old links into
# a working one, forever.
#
# Old shapes, both covered:  /a2            → /guide/a2
#                            /?id=a2        → /guide?id=a2   (the page reads ?id= too)
#
# 301 = permanent, so phones and Airbnb cache the new address.

/data.json    https://oujares.com/guide/data.json    301
/             https://oujares.com/guide              301
/*            https://oujares.com/guide/:splat       301
